{"4007690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gestalt System", "steam_appid": 4007690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is still approximately one year away from its minimum viable version. The following content will be gradually updated and added in future versions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/f35d1dde346d6cde6e0c6f3620af704d.poster.avif?t=1784614876\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/f35d1dde346d6cde6e0c6f3620af704d.webm?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/f35d1dde346d6cde6e0c6f3620af704d.mp4?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ASSEMBLE YOUR TEAM</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and log in—it's training time! Seven minutes of intense action stem from 7,000 attempts! What? No gaming in the lab? Captain, let me explain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/804e03dbc7f89ba4f69a036802c4ff9a.poster.avif?t=1784614876\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/804e03dbc7f89ba4f69a036802c4ff9a.webm?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/804e03dbc7f89ba4f69a036802c4ff9a.mp4?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FIGHT WITH STRATEGY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control tactical bonus points, infiltrate enemy backlines, focus fire on high-value targets—collaborate with teammates to execute tactics and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/11fc08dd60ace4ad118fb0cc0acb3116.poster.avif?t=1784614876\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/11fc08dd60ace4ad118fb0cc0acb3116.webm?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/11fc08dd60ace4ad118fb0cc0acb3116.mp4?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DESTROY THE BASE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train yourself and your AI through FPS MOBA gameplay. Break through enemy lines, destroy their base, and claim ultimate triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/0e47e47f6ad2c88b5d9a56438486dd18.poster.avif?t=1784614876\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/0e47e47f6ad2c88b5d9a56438486dd18.webm?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/0e47e47f6ad2c88b5d9a56438486dd18.mp4?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CHOOSE YOUR MECH </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(currently not supported)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage dealer? Support? Or a nimble scout? Select a mech configuration that matches your style and training goals. Gain experience in battles and fully prepare for the upcoming offline tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/5cc98df7fb475d9d3fc8f3f9b68f3c8d.poster.avif?t=1784614876\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/5cc98df7fb475d9d3fc8f3f9b68f3c8d.webm?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>OR PERHAPS YOU HAVE YOUR OWN PRIDE </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(currently not supported, will support through workshop)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Workshop to add mechs designed by yourself. Bring your own creations into battles and explore uncharted arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/bf9250c6c9fd32f4ff6e8439285bc0a9.poster.avif?t=1784614876\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/bf9250c6c9fd32f4ff6e8439285bc0a9.webm?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/bf9250c6c9fd32f4ff6e8439285bc0a9.mp4?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>TRANSCEND TIME AND SPACE </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(only 2026 &amp; 2024 version maps are implemented for now)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The past you speak of... Is it the past we once shared? Those arenas we once conquered or never set foot on are now possible here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >// AI gameplay overlay GIF</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CONNECT YOU, ME &amp; HIM/HER/THEM </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(AI protocol rules are still under discussion; join our QQ groups for more info)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human-to-human collaboration, human-to-AI collaboration, and even AI-to-AI collaboration. We will use gaming as a medium to explore the future of human-machine cooperation and competition. We look forward to the day when they transition from the virtual world to reality.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is still approximately one year away from its minimum viable version. The following content will be gradually updated and added in future versions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/f35d1dde346d6cde6e0c6f3620af704d.poster.avif?t=1784614876\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/f35d1dde346d6cde6e0c6f3620af704d.webm?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007690/extras/f35d1dde346d6cde6e0c6f3620af704d.mp4?t=1784614876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ASSEMBLE YOUR TEAM</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and log in—i